    {
      "id": "https://atoposyz.github.io/posts/CourseOfDCS_2",
      "url": "https://atoposyz.github.io/posts/CourseOfDCS_2",
      "title": "分布计算系统笔记——第二章 进程通信",
      "content_html": "<h2>同节点进程通信</h2>\n<p>信号、管道、命名管道、消息队列、信号灯、共享内存、内存映像</p>\n<h3>管道</h3>\n<h4>无名管道</h4>\n<p>无名管道只能在有亲缘关系的进程之间使用(例如父进程和子进</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://atoposyz.github.io/posts/CourseOfDCS_2\" target=\"_blank\">https://atoposyz.github.io/posts/CourseOfDCS_2</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
      "date_published": "2024-11-25T20:25:11.000Z",
      "date_modified": "2024-11-25T20:25:11.000Z",
      "authors": [
